# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# research/ is allowlisted, not denylisted: only the logic-analyzer captures
# and the decoder are published. Everything else in that directory is local
# working material (exploit scripts, BLE probes, vendor binaries) and must
# stay untracked even if a new file appears there later.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local probe tooling. These embed a live API key and target debug logging the
# component no longer emits, so they are not published.
/watch_klv_changes.py
esphome/mcu_probe.py
esphome/test_cmd.py

research/*
